  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>What it is: </strong>An easy-to-use, buildable gel-cream blush for a sunset-inspired flush so natural, it’s like your skin made it.<br><br><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light<br><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Cream <br><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Soluble Collagen: Retains water and leaves cheeks looking fresh and dewy.<br>- Smooth Gel System: Has a lightweight gel-cream texture for silky, even application.<br>- Blurring Powder Pigments: Give a soft, diffused, seamless finish with no streakiness.<br><br><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> It is cruelty-free.<br><br><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This lightweight gel-cream blush uses sheer, buildable pigments for finger-first, easy applica</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Gently squeeze a tiny dot of blush onto fingers. <br>-Dab your fingertips directly onto skin to blend. <br>-Apply blush directly to the apples of your cheeks and then blend up and out.<br>-Team tip: mix multiple shades of blush together to create a custom cheek shade. Combine shades on the back of your hand before applying to cheeks.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Soluble Collagen: Helps retain water and leaves cheeks looking fresh and dewy.<br>-Smooth-Gel System: Has a lightweight gel-cream texture for silky, even application.<br>-Blurring Powder Pigments: Give a soft, diffused, seamless finish with no streakiness.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, Cyclopentasiloxane, Methyl Trimethicone, Mica, Butylene Glycol, PEG-10 Dimethicone, Dicaprylyl Carbonate, Neopentyl Glycol Diheptanoate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Glycerin, Vinyl Dimethicone/Methicone Silsesquioxane Crosspolymer, Sorbitan Isostearate, Soluble Collagen, Ethylhexylglycerin, Magnesium Sulfate, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Methyl Methacrylate Crosspolymer, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Disodium EDTA, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Pentylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Silica, Aluminum Hydroxide, Tin Oxide, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Carmine (CI 75470), Ultramarines (CI 77007), Manganese Violet (CI 77742), Red 7 (CI 15850), Red 30 Lake (CI 73360).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Light Coverage</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cream Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>What it is: </strong>An easy-to-use, buildable gel-cream blush for a sunset-inspired flush so natural, it’s like your skin made it.<br><br><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light<br><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Cream <br><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Soluble Collagen: Retains water and leaves cheeks looking fresh and dewy.<br>- Smooth Gel System: Has a lightweight gel-cream texture for silky, even application.<br>- Blurring Powder Pigments: Give a soft, diffused, seamless finish with no streakiness.<br><br><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> It is cruelty-free.<br><br><strong>What Else You Need to Know:</strong> This lightweight gel-cream blush uses sheer, buildable pigments for finger-firs