sodium EDTA, Polyglyceryl-2 Triisostearate, Pentylene Glycol, Phenoxyethanol, Silica, Aluminum Hydroxide, Tin Oxide, Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77492), Carmine (CI 75470), Ultramarines (CI 77007), Manganese Violet (CI 77742), Red 7 (CI 15850), Red 30 Lake (CI 73360).</div></details>",
